{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 230962, "name": "NAVras", "username": "navras", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T09:22:07.943Z", "cooked": "<p>I have a Fedora Workstation installation, and I have not installed unbound. Yet I have <code>/var/lib/unbound</code> and <code>/etc/unbound</code> which are freshly modified and read. <code>/var/lib/unbound</code> is even owned by user <code>unbound</code>. Though there is no <code>unbound.conf</code>. I checked system-monitor, but there is no process owned by <code>unbound</code> user.<br>\nWhat process created and is using those folders? I’m guessing one of <code>systemd</code> service since only <code>root</code> can impersonate other users.</p>\n<p>p.s. I thought I was configuring my <code>unbound</code> installation on my server, until I realized I wasn’t looking at files on the server but my own PC.</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T09:22:07.943Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 169, "reads": 30, "readers_count": 29, "score": 856.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "NAVras", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/compare-installed-packages-with-fedora-default/85689", "internal": true, "reflection": true, "title": "Compare installed packages with Fedora default?", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 4817, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/who-created-unbound-folders/85662/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 230966, "name": "Villy Kruse", "username": "vekruse", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/v/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T09:39:55.396Z", "cooked": "<p>You can find out by running these command:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">rpm -qf /etc/unbound\n</code></pre>\n<p>and</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">rpm -qf /etc/unbound/*\n</code></pre>\n<p>Similar for any other file or directory you might be interested in.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T09:39:55.396Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 28, "readers_count": 27, "score": 115.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "Villy Kruse", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 5}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 8762, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/who-created-unbound-folders/85662/2", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 5}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 5, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 230985, "name": "Flo", "username": "augenauf", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/603e79/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T13:33:38.783Z", "cooked": "<p>If you didn’t install unbound, it may be a dependency of another package that you installed. You can check</p>\n<pre><code>dnf repoquery --installed --whatrequires unbound\n</code></pre>\n<p>or simply</p>\n<pre><code>repoquery --installed --whatrequires unbound\n</code></pre>\n<p>If you want to check with which attributes files and directories of unbound are created, check <a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/unbound/blob/rawhide/f/unbound.spec#_281\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Tree - rpms/unbound - src.fedoraproject.org</a> and  <a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/unbound/blob/rawhide/f/unbound.spec#_410\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Tree - rpms/unbound - src.fedoraproject.org</a> and above and below.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T13:37:05.491Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 19, "readers_count": 18, "score": 33.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "Flo", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/unbound/blob/rawhide/f/unbound.spec#_410", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Tree - rpms/unbound - src.fedoraproject.org", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/unbound/blob/rawhide/f/unbound.spec#_281", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Tree - rpms/unbound - src.fedoraproject.org", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": "Q&A Leader", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 199, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/who-created-unbound-folders/85662/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 230994, "name": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "username": "vgaetera", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/{size}/2552_2.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T13:43:18.718Z", "cooked": "<pre><code class=\"lang-bash\">sudo dnf --assumeno remove /var/lib/unbound\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T13:43:18.718Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 1, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 18, "readers_count": 17, "score": 33.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 4817, "username": "navras", "name": "NAVras", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/afea85/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 549, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/who-created-unbound-folders/85662/4", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 231045, "name": "NAVras", "username": "navras", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T16:28:11.473Z", "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the replies. The files belongs to <code>unbound-libs</code> <code>unbound-anchor</code> and was possibly installed during Fedora 38 upgrade.<br>\nThough I wonder why <code>dnf autoremove</code> doesn’t include them, is there a way to see the reason?</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\ncommands</summary>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">$ rpm -qf /etc/unbound/*\nunbound-libs-1.17.1-2.fc38.x86_64\nunbound-anchor-1.17.1-2.fc38.x86_64\nunbound-libs-1.17.1-2.fc38.x86_64\n\n$ dnf repoquery --installed --whatrequires unbound-libs\npython3-unbound-0:1.17.1-2.fc38.x86_64\nunbound-anchor-0:1.17.1-2.fc38.x86_64\n\n$ dnf repoquery --installed --whatrequires unbound-anchor\n$ dnf repoquery --installed --whatrequires python3-unbound\n\n$ sudo dnf --assumeno remove /etc/unbound\nRemoving:\n unbound-libs\nRemoving dependent packages:\n python3-unbound\nRemoving unused dependencies:\n unbound-anchor\n\n$ rpm -qi unbound-anchor\nInstall Date: Thu 20 Apr 2023 21:09:20 UTC\n\n$ dnf history\nID     | Command line    | Date and time    | Action(s)      | Altered\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n    85 |                 | 2023-04-20 21:06 | D, E, I, U     | 1906\n\n$ sudo dnf autoremove\nLast metadata expiration check: 6:18:27 ago on Wed 12 Jul 2023 09:53:14 UTC.\nDependencies resolved.\nNothing to do.\n</code></pre>\n</details>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T16:34:09.551Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 15, "readers_count": 14, "score": 8.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "NAVras", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 4817, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/who-created-unbound-folders/85662/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 231055, "name": "NAVras", "username": "navras", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T16:59:51.286Z", "cooked": "<p><code>dnf repoquery --userinstalled</code> lists a screen full of packages, but those 3 are not in the list.</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T17:37:15.359Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 11, "readers_count": 10, "score": 2.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "NAVras", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 4817, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/who-created-unbound-folders/85662/6", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 231057, "name": "Barry A Scott", "username": "barryascott", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T17:01:52.172Z", "cooked": "<p>You can dnf history command to find when those rpms where installed.<br>\nDon’t have the exact dnf command at my finger tips.</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T17:01:52.172Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 11, "readers_count": 10, "score": 7.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "Barry A Scott", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Building the Outer Ring (Copr Build VI)", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 4817, "username": "navras", "name": "NAVras", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/afea85/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 4115, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/who-created-unbound-folders/85662/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 231082, "name": "Villy Kruse", "username": "vekruse", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/v/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T18:00:54.090Z", "cooked": "<p>Parts of <code>gnutls</code> needs some library provided by <code>unbound-libs</code>.</p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T18:00:54.090Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 10, "readers_count": 9, "score": 22.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "Villy Kruse", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 8762, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/who-created-unbound-folders/85662/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 231098, "name": "NAVras", "username": "navras", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2023-07-12T18:28:10.557Z", "cooked": "<p>Welp I think I found it. <code>python3-unbound</code> is <a href=\"https://dnf.readthedocs.io/en/latest/command_ref.html#select-options\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">recommended</a> by <code>python3-dnf</code> which is required by base system (anaconda, dnf etc.). It then brought in the 2 dependencies. And because it’s only recommended not required, <code>dnf</code> shows them ok to be uninstalled.</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\ncommands</summary>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">$ dnf repoquery --installed --whatdepends python3-unbound\npython3-dnf-0:4.16.1-1.fc38.noarch\n\n$ dnf repoquery --installed --whatrecommends python3-unbound\npython3-dnf-0:4.16.1-1.fc38.noarch\n\n$ dnf repoquery --installed --whatrequires python3-dnf\nanaconda-core-0:38.23.4-2.fc38.x86_64\ndnf-0:4.16.1-1.fc38.noarch\npython3-dnf-plugins-core-0:4.4.1-1.fc38.noarch\npython3-libreport-0:2.17.11-1.fc38.x86_64\n</code></pre>\n</details>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2023-07-12T18:35:25.753Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 2, "reads": 8, "readers_count": 7, "score": 11.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 85662, "topic_slug": "who-created-unbound-folders", "display_username": "NAVras", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null